  20| # Directory-boundary aware containment. 'C:\root2' is NOT inside 'C:\root'
  21| # even though 'C:\root2'.StartsWith('C:\root') is true. Windows path
  22| # comparison is case-insensitive, so the ordinal-ignore-case comparer is used.
